@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@accessToken = PEGAR_AQUÍ_ACCESS_TOKEN
@roomId = PEGAR_AQUÍ_GUID_SALA
@roomVersion = 1

### Registrar DJ (si no hay sesión)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "dj@example.com",
  "password": "passphrase-de-12-chars-minimo",
  "artistName": "DJ Example"
}

### Iniciar sesión y obtener token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "dj@example.com",
  "password": "passphrase-de-12-chars-minimo"
}

### Crear sala
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mi Fiesta",
  "startsAt": "2026-12-01T20:00:00-06:00",
  "endsAt": "2026-12-02T02:00:00-06:00",
  "timezone": "America/Mexico_City"
}

### Crear sala con timezone omitida (usa default America/Mexico_City)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sala sin timezone",
  "startsAt": "2026-12-01T20:00:00-06:00",
  "endsAt": "2026-12-02T02:00:00-06:00"
}

### Crear sala con timezone inválida (esperado: 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sala tz inválida",
  "startsAt": "2026-12-01T20:00:00-06:00",
  "endsAt": "2026-12-02T02:00:00-06:00",
  "timezone": "Invalid/Zone"
}

### Crear sala con timezone Windows (esperado: 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sala tz Windows",
  "startsAt": "2026-12-01T20:00:00-06:00",
  "endsAt": "2026-12-02T02:00:00-06:00",
  "timezone": "Central Standard Time"
}

### Listar salas (paginado)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Detalle de sala
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Reprogramar sala (requiere todos los campos, sin parciales)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "version": {{roomVersion}},
  "name": "Sala Renombrada",
  "startsAt": "2026-12-01T21:00:00-06:00",
  "endsAt": "2026-12-02T03:00:00-06:00",
  "timezone": "Europe/Madrid"
}

### Reprogramar con versión obsoleta (esperado: 409)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "version": 999,
  "name": "Sala Renombrada",
  "startsAt": "2026-12-01T21:00:00-06:00",
  "endsAt": "2026-12-02T03:00:00-06:00",
  "timezone": "Europe/Madrid"
}

### Pausar sala
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/state
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "state": "pausada",
  "version": {{roomVersion}}
}

### Reabrir sala
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/state
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "state": "abierta",
  "version": {{roomVersion}}
}

### Cerrar sala
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/state
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "state": "cerrada",
  "version": {{roomVersion}}
}

### Cambio de estado con versión obsoleta (esperado: 409)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/state
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "state": "pausada",
  "version": 999
}

### Estado inválido (esperado: 400)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/state
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "state": "invalida",
  "version": {{roomVersion}}
}

### Sin token (esperado: 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms

### Campos extra del cliente se ignoran en creación
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sala Manip",
  "startsAt": "2026-12-01T20:00:00-06:00",
  "endsAt": "2026-12-02T02:00:00-06:00",
  "timezone": "America/Mexico_City",
  "id": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "codigo": "MANIPCODE1",
  "estado": "cerrada",
  "djId": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222",
  "version": 99,
  "purgeAt": "2026-12-08T00:00:00+00:00"
}
